===A1_S4_D3===
Narrator: As the day wanes, you regroup with Chione, who gives you instructions for when to grab dinner and where to turn in for the night. 
Chione: Elder Silas is pretty busy today, but he’s allowed you to stay here for the night in one of our guesthouses. #portrait:ChioneLaugh
Chione: I’m sure today must’ve been nothing short of exhausting, but you can rest easy with our hunters around! #portrait:ChioneNormal
Noelle: Hunters? You mean the Forest Watchers? #portrait:NoelleShocked
Chione: Yes! While they don’t ‘hunt’ anything in particular, they <i>are</i> highly trained to respond to all sorts of situations. #portrait:ChioneLaugh
Narrator: You imagine having Amaya as one of the guards in your home island. Like Chione says — she does give off the impression of someone formidable, despite your short introduction. #portrait:AmayaAngry
Noelle: Thank you, Chione. Is there enough room for both me and Amelia? #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Chione: Yep! You’ll find two mattresses rolled up and ready to use. Amelia, I wasn’t sure if you were going to return to your pack or not, so… #portrait:ChioneNormal
Narrator: Amelia turns her face away with a huff. 
Amelia: No, I’m staying here. I kind of promised Noelle I’d accompany her, so… #portrait:AmeliaNeutral
Noelle: Thank you, Amelia. #portrait:NoelleBigSmile
Chione: Good thing I’ve prepared two beds just in case! #portrait:ChioneLaugh
Chione: I’ll see you tomorrow. For now, just focus on getting some rest. #portrait:ChioneNormal
